   \[
   \left(\frac{1}{2}\right)^i \left(\frac{1}{2}\right)^{i+1} = 1
   \]
   This is a geometric sequence with a common ratio \( \frac{1}{2} \).

2. **Perimeter Condition:**
   \[
   \frac{m\sqrt{n} - p}{q} = \frac{20}{q}
   \]
